TASK
1. First decide whether one or more EXISTING types fit this card.
2. If an existing type fits, use action="assign_existing" and copy its exact type_id and name.
3. Only if a meaningful distinction is missing, use action="create_new".
4. For every new Type, compare it with up to 5 most similar existing Types. Give one concise line describing the difference from each.
5. Facet-Type should be represented as key-value when the Facet is clear. When Facet inference is weak, leave facet empty and still propose the Type.
6. Do not create near-duplicate names or merely lexical variants of existing Types.

